                                        "entry_id": "79100207-1ba8-3ba6-b6da-6d8471fd393f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To display, demonstrate, show, or present."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d79296b-7f04-4f81-80f9-ce25a3dd8b48",
                                                "sense_id": "d62094fd-24a9-398e-9278-88c61a14c8cf",
                                                "text": "I think the demonstration really showcases the strengths of the software."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29e24e3d-f4ed-4d23-a39d-38b459d12b1c",
                                                "sense_id": "d62094fd-24a9-398e-9278-88c61a14c8cf",
                                                "text": "Today's debates over the place of religion in modern life often showcase the claim that belief in God stifles reason and science."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20578edf-2e73-4bde-80cd-055fd4d5dd24",
                                                "sense_id": "d62094fd-24a9-398e-9278-88c61a14c8cf",
                                                "text": "The women usually wore bikini tops with shorts, swimsuits underneath cover-ups or just swimsuits. Men came in various types of trunks, from traditional boxers, to Speedos, to G-string trunks that showcased their packages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0546ce05-04c7-4957-8356-a2b5fac31526",
                                                "sense_id": "d62094fd-24a9-398e-9278-88c61a14c8cf",
                                                "text": "A traveling exhibition titled 'Sunshine Moving Elementary School', presented by the National Museum of Natural Science in partnership with DELTA Electronics Foundation, will be showcased at the Museum's plaza on Shi-tun Road from Feb. 27 through Apr. 9, 2014. The exhibition will inspire people of every age to be part of green revolution with the example of Ming-chuan Elementary School in Namahsia District, Kaohsiung City."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28a297b5-0532-4619-a4e5-f634534b2f21",
                                                "sense_id": "d62094fd-24a9-398e-9278-88c61a14c8cf",
                                                "text": "The manufacturer showcased vehicles in September 2018, at Derby Litchurch Lane, but they won't be in traffic this year."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
